 of prematurity-induced blindness: birth weight-specific survival and the new epidemic</article-title><source>Pediatrics</source><volume>86</volume><fpage>405</fpage><lpage>412</lpage><year>1990</year><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2388790</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><label>7</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Reynaud</surname><given-names>X.</given-names></name><name><surname>Dorey</surname><given-names>C.K.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Extraretinal neovascularization induced by hypoxic episodes in the neonatal rat</article-title><source>Invest. Ophthalmol. Vis. Sci.</source><volume>35</volume><fpage>3169</fpage><lpage>3177</lpage><year>1994</year><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8045712</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><label>8</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Zhao</surname><given-names>B.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The health effects of tea polyphenols and their antioxidant mechanism</article-title><source>J. Clin. Biochem. Nutr.</source><volume>38</volume><fpage>59</fpage><lpage>68</lpage><year>2006</year></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><label>9</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Crespy</surname><given-names>V.</given-names></name><name><surname>Williamson</surname><given-names>G.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A review of the health effects of green tea catechins in <italic>in vivo</italic> animal models</article-title><source>J. Nutr.</source><volume>134</volume><fpage>3431S</fpage><lpage>3440S</lpage><year>2004</year><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15570050</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><label>10</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cooper</surname><given-names>R.</given-names></name><name><surname>Morre</surname><given-names>D.J.</given-names></name><name><surname>Morre</surname><given-names>D.M.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Medicinal benefits of green tea: Part I. Review of noncancer health benefits</article-title><source>J. Altern. Complement. Med.</source><volume>11</volume><fpage>521</fpage><lpage>528</lpage><year>2005</year><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15992239</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><label>11</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cooper</surname><given-names>R.</given-names></name><name><surname>Morre</surname><given-names>D.J.</given-names></name><name><surname>Morre</surname><given-names>D.M.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Medicinal benefits of green tea: part II. review of anticancer properties</article-title><source>J. Altern. Complement. Med.</source><volume>11</volume><fpage>639</fpage><lpage>652</lpage><year>2005</year><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16131288</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><label>12</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cao</surname><given-names>Y.</given-names></name><name><surname>Cao</surname><given-names>R.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Angiogenesis inhibited by drinking tea</article-title><source>Nature</source><volume>398</volume><fpage>381</fpage><year>1999</year><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10201368</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><label>13</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Minami</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Hasebe</surname><given-names>Y.</given-names></name><name><surname>Nakanishi-Ueda</surname><given-names>T.</given-names></name><name><surname>Iwai</surname><given-names>S.</given-names></name><name><surname>Ueda</surname><given-names>T.</given-names></name><name><surname>Dorey</surname><given-names>C.K.</given-names></name><name><surname>Oguchi</surname><given-names>K.</given-